{{Heroic_Card_Infobox|Cost=5|AbilityCost=2|Rarity=Epic|Type=Troop|Arena=Royal Arena|ReleaseDate=April 6,2026}}
{{Quote|These skyward skellies were never satisfied while six feet under! Aeri and her skeleton crew are known for their semi-well-crafted wings which allow them to dive-bomb without breaking any bones.}}
The Heroic Balloon is a {{Rarity|Epic}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked with 200 {{Icon|I=Hero Shard}}. It spawns a single-target, [[:Category:Building Cards|building]]-targeting, melee, air [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with high hitpoints and very high damage. When defeated, it drops a bomb which explodes after 3 seconds, dealing moderate damage. It is a hot air balloon with a team-colored envelope and a wooden basket with sacks held together by patches and ropes, and is piloted by a [[Bomber]]. A Heroic Balloon card costs 5 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to deploy.

== Ability: Coffin Cadets ==
{{Quote|A Skeletrooper soars to the nearest enemy on the ground, dealing landing damage.}}{{Hero Ability|2=Coffin Cadets}}
The Hero Knight has a special ability accessible from whatever side of the screen was put in, just above the player's [[Cards|card]] slots in [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. Once pressed, a skeletropper will fly towards the closest ground unit within 6 tiles, deling spawn damage. The skeletropper will the attack, dealing less damage to the crown tower. The Coffin Cadets ability costs 2 [[Elixir]] to activate.

==Strategy==
*The ability can be used to kill units like [[Musketeer]] and [[Wizard]], or buildings.
*When defending, put troops like [[Skeletons]] closer, so that they can take the agro of the ability.

