== History ==
2026
* On 6/4/2026, with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/4/2026)|April 2026 Update]], the Hero Balloon was added in the game, along with [[Minion Horde/Evolution|Evo Minion Horde]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 1/6/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/6/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Skeletrooper's Landing Damage by 14%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 6/7/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/7/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Skeletrooper's Attack Damage by 20%{{Balance|Nerf}} and increased his hit speed to 1.1 seconds (from 0.9 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], made the ability single use (from 12sec cooldown){{Balance|Remove}}.

